WEBVTT

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.440
Have you...

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.650
ever fallen...

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.030
in love?

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:58.890
The Person I Love the Most

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:03.140
Midterms are finally over, aren't they?

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:06.100
I didn't do well on any of them...

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:09.730
Kei-chan, it must've been tough for you because of the sports festival.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.520
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.860
Ayumi-chan, you agree too, right?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.780
Ayumi?

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.330
Zaitsu-kun.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.410
Thanks for these.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.460
As thanks, I'll bake you some cookies, okay?

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.790
N-No, you don't have to.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.000
I'll get them right this time!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:35.420
Okay?

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.880
Really, just the thought is enough.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.430
Here.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.510
I-I'll give it to you.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.100
For picking it up.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:47.930
See ya!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.600
Thanks, Zaitsu-kun.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:54.570
I love candies!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.110
I like Zaitsu-kun even more now!

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.070
But it's so embarrassing I can't say it!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.330
Seems like something good happened to you, Ayumi-chan.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.410
It probably has something to do with Zaitsu-kun, doesn't it?

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.830
Lucky!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.120
I want Onii-chan to think I'm a good girl too!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.040
There it is.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.210
Koyoi's "Onii-chan~"

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.420
If possible, I don't want to run into my sister.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.470
You're the one that said, "Take a look at my sister!"

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.810
I bet she's ugly enough to reduce the world to tears, though.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.230
My Koyoi is a beauty!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.940
She's way prettier than your sister who's just as monkey faced as you!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:32.980
You bastard...

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.270
Don't you dare insult Ayumi when you haven't even seen her before!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.990
Plus, you shouldn't say such weird things.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.410
"The most important woman in this world is..."

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.280
My sister.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.200
I'm telling you that's messed up!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.990
Having romantic feelings for your sister is-

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.160
...isn't messed up at all!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.830
That's because these aren't romantic feelings!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:56.250
This is a love the size of the universe, one that defies time and space!

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.750
That's the only thing that compares.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.090
True love!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.010
As long as she's happy, I'm fine!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.430
Though, I'd be happier if the one by her side were me!

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.310
You idiot, they're going to see us!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.770
Onii-chan!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.480
Koyoi!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.190
I'm so happy!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.230
You came to pick me up!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.520
"Onii-chan"?!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.860
T-This is Bessho's...

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.200
What are you doing here, Onii-chan?!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.790
This is embarrassing, so hurry and get off!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.160
You've been thinking a lot about me, haven't you?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.210
I love you, Onii-chan!

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.340
What's with these completely opposite reactions?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.510
Koyoi-chan has a huge brother complex.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.720
Who's that?

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.840
So that's the fabled brother.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.050
Your friends are looking at you weird!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.850
I won't get off until you take me home!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:57.360
Okay... W-Well, Arihara, I'm just going to go home.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.360
Bye everyone! See you all tomorrow!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.690
That's the first time I've seen Koyoi-chan's brother, but...

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.450
They don't look alike at all.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:09.950
I was wondering how hot he would be after hearing her go "Onii-chan! Onii-chan!"

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.410
Well, Ayumi's brother's also...

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.290
It's pretty bad, isn't it?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.670
Why aren't there any decent men around me?

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.960
It's not nice of you to say things like that!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.590
Don't talk behind my back! It only makes me sass!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:30.930
Well then Ayumi, how about we go home together once in a while too?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.350
Keep the jokes to yourself!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.060
That's why I told you my brother isn't cool!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.360
Ayumi's also at a difficult age.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:53.700
Mommy, two good things happened today.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.830
The first is that midterms are over,

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:01.250
and the second is that Onii-chan came all the way to school to pick me up.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.260
But the thing that makes me even happier is...

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.130
Koyoi Midterms

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:08.840
Daddy's Business Trip

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.640
Starting tomorrow, I'll be alone with Onii-chan!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.360
Onii-chan~

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.320
What are you doing?

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.700
I was warming up your pajamas for you!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.650
You don't need to do that.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.450
But you just got warmed up in the bath,

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.950
so you wouldn't like it if they were cold when you put them on, right?

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:37.250
I don't want you to catch a cold!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.040
Oh, I see. Thanks.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.500
So treat me like a good girl, Onii-

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.000
Don't get carried away!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.510
This and that are two completely different things!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.510
Onii-chan, you meanie!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.640
But starting tomorrow...

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.270
Okay, okay.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.560
Onii-chan, ahhhh.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:04.360
Things like this and things like that!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:09.030
The old man went to gather firewood...

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:16.120
I hope Daddy's business trip lasts even one day longer!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.420
Ok, the lunchboxes are ready.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.090
Onii-chan, wake up!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.470
Hey, you've got cleaning duty today so you have to get to school early, don't you?

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.430
If you don't hurry and wake up...

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.100
I'll give you a wake up kiss!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.140
N-No, no, no! Anything but that!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.520
Gosh, I was just kidding.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.900
You're such a bad sport, Onii-chan.

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.110
It's already this late?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.780
I'm leaving!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.150
Wait, onii-chan!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.450
Here's your lunch.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:52.990
It's all right.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.580
I'm too embarrassed to eat such a decorated lunch in front of everyone.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.620
Today's is normal.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.540
Also...

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.250
All done.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.040
It's like we're newlyweds.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.090
Damn it! I lost precious time for no reason!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.850
Onii-chan...

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.270
I don't get it at all!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.390
I accidentally thought of my brother just now!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:28.900
I don't know how I'd see him as a man at all!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.730
Really?

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.690
What about your family, Doba-chan?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:34.490
I don't really talk with my brother.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.280
I know, right?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.910
They act so proud, stupid, and annoying even though they're so stupid!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.830
There's no way to live peacefully with those smelly feet either, right?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.040
When you fight with him, you fight him whole-heartedly, don't you?

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.290
It's a do-or-die death match, isn't it?!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.630
I think your household is just a little different.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.760
Our relationship at home isn't that bad...

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.210
See? See?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.840
Then... Then what about you, Kei-chan?

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.930
Oh, you just have an older sister.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:57.720
Yup.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.220
What about your family, Chikura-chan?

00:08:59.220 --> 00:08:59.970
Huh?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:03.230
Chikura's brother is really handsome.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.310
I would understand if Chikura ever started liking her brother,

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.650
Koyoi's is just plain, or lame, I guess.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.150
Kei-Kei-chan...

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.070
She's right there!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:15.950
O-Oh, sorry.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.280
I'm so glad!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.530
Huh?!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.080
About what?

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:26.250
I was thinking if one of you started liking Onii-chan, I wouldn't know what to do.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.330
But now I know that won't happen.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.420
I'm really glad!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.880
And the day her brother gets a girlfriend...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.890
Koyoi-chan will be shocked...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.720
because of the sister-in-law.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.020
She wouldn't hesitate to poison her.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.600
I told you that's not possible.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.820
But I'm telling you it's good! Put sugar on chawanmushi!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.740
It's okay. I'll pass.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.900
Enomoto, how about you?

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:56.990
Did you try it?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:02.990
No, I'm obsessed with Nostradamus's "The Prophecies", so I don't have time for that!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.910
You've got another hobby.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:09.290
I'll pass on both Nostradamus and sugar on chawanmushi.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:14.550
I would pass too, but I guess I can't say that out loud.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.850
What part of this is a regular bento?! What part?!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.930
What's wrong, Bessho-kun?

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.350
Did you get something you hate eating?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.020
Tomatoes with sugar on them?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.390
Something like that!

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.400
Sorry for being so loud.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.820
See? I told you.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.320
Putting sugar on tomatoes or chawanmushi is unbelievable.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.900
Good thing they didn't see it.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.580
Wait, what does she mean by sugar on tomatoes?

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.790
Stop saying "Unbelievable!" and just try it once.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.040
Yamamoto-san.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.370
Enomoto, you too.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.290
What?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.960
Arihara's sister?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.630
Yeah, my precious sister.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:01.180
Why did she have to fall in love with a beast like that of all people?

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.810
Well if that's what makes her happy, then...

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:09.480
Is staying silent while watching her get defiled by his hands the only thing I can do?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.520
You've got to be kidding!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:14.980
What part of that frightening guy is she drawn to exactly?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.070
It's the candy.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.280
Candy?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.360
Yeah.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.700
It tastes like Zaitsu-kun~

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:35.210
He won my sister over with a lollipop!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.880
Unforgivable!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.170
I don't get it at all...

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.350
Yamamoto-san.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.600
Wait here.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.480
I'll show you how it happened with a live demo.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:51.100
Demo?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:51.890
H-Hey!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.270
Hey, Yamamoto!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.900
That looks really tiring.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.280
Isn't it really heavy?

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.200
I'll carry it for you.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.160
Huh?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.990
Before that, let me give you a reward.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.240
Get out of the way if you don't plan to help.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.290
Are you stupid?!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.250
What are you doing to Yamamoto-san?!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.500
Sorry, my bad.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.760
I'll carry that for you.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.260
Sorry, Yamamoto-san. Just throw it away if it creeps you out.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.800
What? You're so rude!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:25.840
Let's go.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.640
H-Hey, you're going to make me drop it!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.060
Why did you do that all of a sudden?

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.190
Look.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.730
She's totally pissed off.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.520
Yeah, I guess it would piss her off.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.020
But my sister apparently enjoys it.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:43.900
As a brother, I'm shocked that she falls for things like that!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.950
You had better apologize.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.410
Why did you get mad all of a sudden?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.660
I'm not mad!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.540
See? You are.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.790
I told you I'm not!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.250
I'm home.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.720
Welcome home.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:10.510
Would you like to have dinner or...

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:11.890
a bath?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.810
Don't tell me you plan on continuing this morning newlyweds act?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:21.780
But starting today, it's just going to be you and me living alone together!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.700
Crap! Dad left on his business trip today!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.240
This sucks!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:33.120
Dinner or a bath?

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.750
Or m-a-y-b-e...

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.310
What's this?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.140
Theres a lobster. A lobster!

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:55.930
Yeah!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:14:00.060
It's our first day together, so I put some effort into it!

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.150
Are you stupid?!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:01.940
Huh?

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.530
You don't like lobster?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.070
That's not it.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.320
We need to save money!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.110
How much did this cost?

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.490
The bento too...

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.490
Can you stop doing things like that?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.080
No, uh...

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:20.540
Sorry for saying such harsh things when you make lunch for me everyday.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.260
Koyoi, your cooking is really good, you know!

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:31.680
But... decorated lunches and "LOVE" are a bit-

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.930
But I love you, Onii-chan!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.560
Crap...

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.180
Back to this again...

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:41.020
Okay, okay. Let's eat before it gets cold.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.400
Okay!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:45.820
Here, Onii-chan. Aah!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.360
Gosh, you're so shy.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.080
Man, right when Dad leaves she goes and does as she pleases.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.120
Onii-chan.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:00.790
What?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.630
I'll wash your back for you.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:05.380
Whoa! Stupid! Don't just barge in here!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.170
Don't be embarrassed. Come on, hurry!

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.970
Isn't it normal to be embarrassed?

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.760
The phone's ringing!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:12.890
It might be Dad!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.560
Stupid Daddy.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.190
Hello? Bessho residence.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.320
Oh, um...

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.780
Is Yoshihiko-kun available?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.030
A girl's voice?

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:35.990
My name is Yamamoto. Is Yoshihiko-kun there.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.120
Yoshihiko-kun?!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.460
Um... Hello?

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:44.670
Maybe you have us mixed up with a different Bessho?

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.750
Jeez...

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:51.630
Bessho is a really common last name too.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.470
And our Yoshihiko never has females contact him, so...

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.180
Are you listening, Yamamoto-san?

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.680
Yamamoto-san?

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.100
Yamamoto-san?!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.650
Hello?! It's me!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.690
No...

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.860
Yamamoto-san?! Good evening!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.360
Girlfriend?

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:11.400
No, no. My little sister. It was my little sister.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.070
Huh?

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.030
Tomorrow?

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.030
You want to talk?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.830
Yeah, it's fine.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.580
Onii-chan, you're smiling too much!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.420
